    "golden-3-casual-human": {
      "text": "Honestly I didn't expect the trip to go the way it did. We missed the first train, then the replacement bus dropped us miles from the hotel, and by the time we walked in the rain had properly set in. But the odd thing is those are the bits I remember fondly now. The receptionist lent us towels. Some bloke in the bar drew us a map of shortcuts his dad used when he worked the docks. You can't plan for that stuff. The castle itself was fine, I suppose, worth an hour, but ask me about that week and I'll tell you about the bus and the map and the towels before anything else.",
